# Keep the build context to what the image needs.
#
# node_modules in particular must not ride along: the host's were installed for
# glibc, and COPY web/ would lay them over the Alpine `npm ci` result. Secrets
# and runtime state never need to reach the Docker daemon at all.
.git
.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
web/dist
static
data
.env
*.key
*.pem
